sentences.text:
District NC:
2025:KHC-K:104 & Sessions Judge, Raichur, Sitting at Sindhanuru and Special Judge for POCSO case, subject to the following conditions:
a) The petitioner shall execute personal bond for a sum of Rs.1,00,000/- with two sureties for the likesum, to the satisfaction of the jurisdictional Court;
b) The petitioner shall appear regularly on all the dates of hearing before the Trial Court unless the Trial Court exempts his appearance for valid reasons;

c) The petitioner shall not directly or indirectly threaten or tamper with the prosecution witnesses;
d) The petitioner shall not involve in similar offences in future;
Sd/-
(S.VISHWAJITH SHETTY) JUDGE DHA CT:PK Saleem vs The State And Anr on 9 January, 2025 Indian Kanoon - http://indiankanoon.org/doc/125894715/
